        ["layout.copies"] = ("module: place this layout {0}× (each makes 1/{0} of the output)", "Modul: dieses Layout {0}× bauen (je 1/{0} der Menge)", "module : placer cette disposition {0}× (chacune 1/{0} de la production)"),
        ["layout.info"] = ("{0:0} × {1:0} foundations ({2:0} × {3:0} m) · {4} rows · {5} bus lanes", "{0:0} × {1:0} Fundamente ({2:0} × {3:0} m) · {4} Reihen · {5} Bus-Spuren", "{0:0} × {1:0} fondations ({2:0} × {3:0} m) · {4} rangées · {5} voies du bus"),
        ["layout.legend"] = ("Sky view, north up; one floor at a time (Show) — other floors as dashed outlines. Rows of machine groups: inputs arrive on belts south of each row (white squares = splitters), outputs leave on belts north of it (outlined squares = mergers). Each item has one vertical trunk placed next to its machines; arrows show the flow. Station boxes sit at the east end of the bottom row with a free outer side: green = inputs, violet = outputs, grey = spare/overflow. ⊕ = each group's corner anchor on a foundation corner, the rest follow at the stated spacing. Dashed with orange ends = lifted over other belts or machines (never over machines taller than 12 m). Purple square ⇅ = conveyor lift / pipe to another floor. Floors are 12 m apart, 16 m when a floor has machines taller than 11 m; buildings taller than 15 m only on the top floor. Red = clog guard (square: smart splitter overflow, diamond: valve). Sizes: satisfactory-calculator.com, heights: satisfactory.wiki.gg.", "Ein Stockwerk, Norden oben. Unterkante = Bahnhofswand: grün = Eingänge, violett = Ausgänge, grau = Überschuss. Links = Bus (eine Spur pro Gegenstand und Bandlinie). Reihen = Maschinen, von Süden per Verteiler versorgt (weiße Quadrate = Splitter), im Norden gesammelt (umrandete Quadrate = Zusammenführer). Gelb = Bänder, blau = Rohre (Punkte = Verbindungsstücke). Rot = Stauschutz (Quadrat: Splitter-Überlauf, Raute: Ventil). ⤒n = Bandlifte über n Bus-Spuren. Gebäudegrößen von satisfactory-calculator.com.", "Un seul étage, nord en haut. Bord inférieur = mur de gare : vert = entrées, violet = sorties, gris = surplus. À gauche = bus (une voie par objet et ligne). Rangées = machines, alimentées au sud par un collecteur (carrés blancs = répartiteurs), collectées au nord (carrés vides = fusionneurs). Jaune = convoyeurs, bleu = tuyaux (points = jonctions). Rouge = anti-blocage (carré : débordement, losange : vanne). ⤒n = ascenseurs au-dessus de n voies. Tailles des bâtiments : satisfactory-calculator.com."),
        ["layout.saved"] = ("Saved {0}", "{0} gespeichert", "{0} enregistré"),
        ["layout.anchor"] = ("⊕ corner anchor at foundation ({0:0}, {1:0}), then every {2:0} m", "⊕ Eck-Anker auf Fundament ({0:0}, {1:0}), dann alle {2:0} m", "⊕ ancre (coin) à la fondation ({0:0}, {1:0}), puis tous les {2:0} m"),
